实有效。"},"318":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#websocket-连接建立流程","content":"建立连接后每隔 30s，评测端发送 {\"key\":\"ping\"}。"},"319":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#语言配置下发","content":"在连接建立后，Web 端会向 Judge 分发服务端的语言设置。如果客户端需要进行特殊设置，可忽略此条消息。"},"320":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#评测任务推送","content":"Web 端会通过 WebSocket 向评测端推送评测任务。"},"321":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#评测任务推送","content":"注1：如果比赛 ID 为 000000000000000000000000 则表示此提交为自测提交，自测提交使用 input 字段值作为程序输入。注2：source 字段为缓存 ID，同 source 字段的提交使用相同的缓存目录。注3：source 字段包含且仅包含一个字符 /，建议使用 domainId/pid。注4：测试数据的 etag 用来识别本地缓存的文件是否与云端一致，可使用 hash 或是修改时间的时间戳。"},"322":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#测试数据下载","content":"若推送的评测任务中使用了的测试数据缺失，Judge 端会向 Web 请求缺失或是修改的文件。"},"323":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#测试数据下载","content":"服务端返回如下："},"324":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#评测结果上报","content":"除 key, domainId, rid 三个字段外，其他字段均为可选。关于 STATUS_CODE 含义请查看 hydro-dev/Hydro/packages/utils/lib/status 。当 key 为 end 时表示评测任务已经完成，结果确定，Web 端可进行 AC 数计量，登记成绩表等操作。"},"325":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/dev/PERM_PRIV","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/dev/PERM_PRIV","type":"page","content":"权限节点","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Hydro","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/dev/PERM_PRIV"},"326":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/dev/PERM_PRIV-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/dev/PERM_PRIV","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/dev/PERM_PRI