"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"该方法可以帮助您在任意服务器上部署评测机。"},"715":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"type: warn"},"716":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"我们推荐所有独立评测机使用相同配置机器并关闭内置评测机, 以保证评测结果的稳定性。系统设置中的评测机相关选项仅控制内置评测机, 独立评测机需要在 judge.yaml 中进行设置。"},"717":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"首先需要创建一个有 PRIV_JUDGE 权限的账户，具体方法参照 此处。（在部署 Hydro 的服务器上运行）"},"718":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"然后在运行评测机的服务器上安装 HydroJudge ："},"719":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"创建目录 ~/.config/hydro，在该目录下创建文件 judge.yaml，配置文件格式如下："},"720":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"设置完之后，使用下面的指令即可开始运行（可以使用 pm2 管理）："},"721":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#更新","content":"HydroJudge 会发布不定期更新。您可以使用 yarn global upgrade-interactive --latest 来检测并进行更新。"},"722":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#关闭","content":"作为附加组件: 在 系统设置>配置管理 中有一栏 Disable builtin judge，将它勾上，然后重启 Hydro。"},"723":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#关闭","content":"作为独立进程: 根据开启的方法关闭。"},"724":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#卸载","content":"关闭后运行下面指令即可。"},"725":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为附加组件-1","content":"在 系统设置>hydrojudge 修改对应的参数，然后重启 Hydro 和 hydrojudge 即可。"},"726":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程-1","content":"如果有需要修改单题测试点数量上限等设置，可以在 ~/.config/hydro/judge.yaml 的末尾添加下列内容："},"727":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程-1","content":"在 此处 的设置均可添加到此处。"},"728":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#修改编译选项添加新语言支持","content":"在 控制面板>系统设置 中修改 hydrooj.langs 配置项(对所有连接到该服务器的评测机生效)或在 ~/.config/hydro/langs.yaml 中配置(对单个独立评测机生效, 不推荐)。"},"729":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#修改编译选项添加新语言支持","content":"文件格式参照 此处 。"},"730":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#修改编译选项添加新语言支持","content":"如果您添加了新的语言，您还需要前往 控制面板>系统设置 中修改 Language Highlight ID 与 Monaco language modes。分别表示选择对应的语言后的高亮设置（基于 PrismJS）和 Monaco 编辑器语法规则设置。"},"731":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#修改编译选项添加新语言支持","content":"修改完后请重启 Hydro 和 hydrojudge 。"},"732":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#修改编译选项添加新语言支持","content":"在 编译器和语言 章节可查看更多信息。"},"733":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调试沙箱环境","content":"如果需要调试沙箱内的编译或者运行错误，可以使用 hydrojudge terminal 来打开评测交互终端。该终端运行于与评测环境相同的独立沙箱内。"},"734":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#清除数据缓存","content":"若需要清除评测数据缓存，可以使用 hydrojudge cache prune 清除 30 天之内未使用的测试数据，需指定天数可添加参数 --duration=x 清除 x 天数据。"},"735":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#清除数据缓存","content":"若需清除所有缓存数据，可以使用 hydrojudge cache clean 命令。"},"736":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#测试数据格式","content":"参照 测试数据格式 配置。"},"737":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"type: warn"},"738":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"如果不调整沙箱的空间大小，当您的评测使用文件 IO 且输入输出文件较大时可能会引发错误。"},"739":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"对于 2022/8/12 前安装的用户："},"740":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"在服务器上运行下面的代码找到 hydro-sandbox 的运行目录："},"741":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"参照 沙箱文件系统挂载文档 中的自定义挂载的配置，保存配置内容到运行目录并命名为 mount.yaml。\n修改配置文件中 work dir 和 tmp dir 所对应 size 和 nr_inodes 的挂载参数至您想要的大小，保存后重启 hydro-sandbox 即可完成更改。"},"742":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"对于 2022/8/12 后安装的用户："},"743":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"编辑 /root/.hydro/mount.yaml，修改 size 即可。"},"744":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#开大程序运行栈空间","content":"2022/8/12 后安装的实例默认已开启无限栈空间，无需手动操作"},"745":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#开大程序运行栈空间","content":"在很多时候系统默认为程序提供的栈空间并不能满足我们的需求，此时我们需要手动为用户程序提供更大的栈空间。"},"746":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#开大程序运行栈空间","content":"修改 pm2 中 hydro-sandbox 的启动参数为 ulimit -s unlimited && /usr/bin/hydro-sandbox ："},"747":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#提高测评精度","content":"禁用 CPU 频率缩放与 Intel 睿频加速技术，防止 CPU 频率波动。"},"748":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#提高测评精度","content":"禁用内存地址空间随机化，以使得存在内存寻址错误的代码能够得到更多可重复的结果，可以通过在 /etc/sysctl.conf 中添加下面这行并运行 sudo sysctl -p 应用："},"749":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#提高测评精度","content":"启用沙箱的 CPU 绑定功能，例如在 8 核系统上，限制评测任务仅使用 CPU 2,4,6 时可以参照以下配置："},"750":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#提高测评精度","content":"这时，最大同时运行任务数限制为 , 分割的核心数量（在这个例子里为 3），并且同时运行的每个评测任务会分别分配到该项配置中的一个核心。启用该配置时， parallelism 建议设置与沙箱任务能够使用的核心数量相同。此项配置需要根据评测机具体的 CPU 配置 (例如是否开启超线程, 使用 NUMA 等情况) 调整。同时，此项配置需要沙箱版本升级至 v1.11.2 或以上。"},"751":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#提高测评精度","content":"同时，如果为了避免其他任务使用这些核心，可以在内核启动参数中使用 isolcpus 配置。例如在 8 核系统上，禁止其他任务使用 CPU 2-7 时可以加入 isolcpus=2-7 内核启动参数。具体可以参照 内存计量不准确 章节内容修改内核启动参数。"},"752":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存计量不准确","content":"在控制面板上出现内容为 You are using cgroup v2 without kernel 5.19+. This could result in inaccurate memory usage measurements. 警告时，意味着当前系统的内存消耗计量存在误差。"},"753":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存计量不准确","content":"部分 Linux 设备默认使用 cgroup2，而在 5.19 版本前的内核的 cgroup2 中移除了精确计量内存消耗的接口。\n若要获得更精确的内存计量，推荐启用 cgroup v1 (您可以通过检查 /sys/fs/cgroup/memory/memory.memsw.usage_in_bytes 是否存在来验证是否当前系统是否启用了 cgroup v1 )："},"754":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存计量不准确","content":"以 Ubuntu 的默认引导器 GRUB 2 为例，编辑 /etc/default/grub：\n在其中"},"755":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存计量不准确","content":"后，加入 `cgroup_enable=memory swapaccount=1 systemd.unified_cgroup_hierarchy=0，变为："},"756":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存计量不准确","content":"运行以下命令更新 GRUB 2 的配置，然后重新启动。"},"757":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-69","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存控制器未开启","content":"在控制面板上出现内容为 The memory cgroup controller is not enabled. This could result in inaccurate memory usage measurements. 警告时，意味着当前系统并没有开启内存 cgroup 控制器。"},"758":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-70","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存控制器未开启","content":"部分 Linux (如 Raspbian) 并不会默认开启内存 cgroup 控制器，启用内存控制器可以获得更精确的内存限制和计量。"},"759":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-71","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存控制器未开启","content":"以 Raspbian 为例，编辑 /boot/firmware/cmdline.txt (如果不存在则 /boot/cmdline.txt)：\n在末尾添加（注意空格）"},"760":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-72","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存控制器未开启","content":"重启之后检查 /proc/cgroups 确认内存控制器 memory 已开启。"},"761":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","type":"page","content":"插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Hydro","插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins"},"762":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins#附加组件列表","content":"附加组件列表"},"763":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins#安装","content":"安装"},"764":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/