ro/FAQ","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#why-cant-i-batch-download-multiple-files","content":"Please use a modern browser and try enabling HTTPS for your site.\nOtherwise, download files one by one (Ctrl+click filename)."},"300":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ-84","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#why-is-there-no-language-option-on-my-submission-page","content":"Problem -> Judge Settings -> Allowed languagesDomain Settings -> Edit Domain Profile -> Allowed languagesIn both places, fill language IDs separated by English commas. If unsure, leave empty."},"301":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ-85","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#the-yarn-global-commands-have-been-remove-in-2x---consider-using-yarn-dlx-or-a-third-party-plugin-instead","content":"If you cannot understand this issue, just use the installation script and do not mess with development mode."},"302":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ-86","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#im-in-a-computer-lab-environment-many-users-share-one-ip-and-trigger-rate-limits-how-to-solve","content":"Option 1: Set up a proxy server in the intranet and forward intranet IPs to the server. (Recommended)Option 2: Use commands like hydrooj cli system set limit.user_login 999 to set new rate limits (the error page shows which limit was triggered)Option 3: Start with pm2 start hydrooj -- --benchmark to disable all rate limits (Not recommended)"},"303":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ-87","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#adjust-temporary-directory-size","content":"Judge stores temporary files in /dev/shm, including contestants' output, compiled executables, etc. These files are automatically deleted after judging.If you set high parallel judging, pay attention to /dev/shm size limit. We usually recommend reserving at least 512MB."},"304":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ-88"