d":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-syzoj","content":"Since the SYZOJ script migrates all data from the original site, it may take a long time to run.\nAfter the script finishes, restart the Hydro instance to automatically complete the remaining upgrade steps.\nAfter migration, log in using the original SYZOJ administrator account."},"908":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-33","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-universaloj","content":"UniversalOJ (commonly called UOJ community edition) uses a migration process similar to the two above. Run the script named migrateUniversalOJ."},"909":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-34","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-universaloj","content":"Because its upgrade process is relatively complex, the installation script already provides automatic upgrade support. If needed, you can run the installation script for one-click migration. For manual migration, please ask in the developer group."},"910":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-35","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-universaloj","content":"Since the UniversalOJ script migrates all data from the original site, it may take a long time to run.\nAfter the script finishes, restart the Hydro instance to automatically complete the remaining upgrade steps.\nAfter migration, log in using the original UniversalOJ administrator account."},"911":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-36","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"type: warn"},"912":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-37","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"Migration will delete all current Hydro data (including user account information) and import vj4 data.\nPlease make sure to back up relevant files."},"913":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-38","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"Please complete Hydro deployment first and finish file service configuration (setting_file).\nBefore migrating data, stop all running vj4 services and keep only its database running.\nNote that the database used by Hydro must not be the same as the source vj4 database.\nIf you are using vj4-docker, you can modify docker-compose.yml to map the database to a different local port."},"914":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-39","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"After installing the plugin, you should find a script named migrateVijos in Control Panel > Script Management.\nIts parameter format is as follows:"},"915":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-40","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"host: database host"},"916":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-41","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"port: database port"},"917":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-42","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"name: database name"},"918":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-43","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"username&password: account/password, use empty strings if none"},"919":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-44","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"In vj4-docker, the database name is vj4 with no account/password."},"920":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-45","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"After the script finishes, restart the Hydro instance to automatically complete the remaining upgrade steps.\nAfter migration, log in using the original vj4 administrator account."},"921":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-46","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"type: warn"},"922":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate-47","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/migrate#upgrade-from-vijos","content":"If your vj4 was upgraded from vj2 or tyvj, do not uninstall this plugin after migration, or some users may be unable to log in."},"923":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha","type":"page","content":"recaptcha","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Hydro","Plugins"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha"},"924":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha-0","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha","content":"We use reCAPTCHA v3 to verify that registrants are human. It is normal not to see a traditional CAPTCHA during registration."},"925":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha-1","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha","content":"Go to https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin/create to create reCAPTCHA keys.\nFor reCAPTCHA type, choose \"reCAPTCHA v3\"."},"926":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha-2","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/recaptcha","content":"After creation, fill the site key and secret key into key and secret under the recaptcha section in System Settings respectively. Restart Hydro, and reCAPTCHA will work properly."},"927":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic","type":"page","content":"Sonic","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Hydro","Plugins"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic"},"928":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic-0","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic#installation","content":"Installation"},"929":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic-1","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic#install-sonic-server","content":"Install sonic-server"},"930":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic-2","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic#install-the-sonic-plugin","content":"Install the sonic plugin"},"931":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic-3","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic#start","content":"Start"},"932":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic-4","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic#configuration","content":"Configuration"},"933":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic-5","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic#backend-address-configuration","content":"Backend address configuration"},"934":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic-6","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic#restart-hydrooj","content":"Restart HydroOJ"},"935":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic-7","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugins/sonic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/Hydro/plugi